# ci-size-gate.allowlist — FLUX-087 escape hatch.
#
# Each line is a repo-relative path (exact match) that is EXEMPT from the
# file-line-count rule (>300 lines / AGENTS.md §1.2). Lines beginning with `#`
# and blank lines are ignored.
#
# SEED (regenerated 2026-08-30 from `git ls-files`): every tracked production
# source file currently over 300 lines. These files are being split under
# FLUX-088 (one file per PR). When a split lands and the file drops to <=300
# lines, REMOVE its line from this allowlist so the gate re-arms on it. Do NOT
# add new paths here to silence the gate — fix the file instead. (Adding an
# entry requires justification in the PR.)
#
# The function-length (>40 lines / §1.2) and unwrap/expect/panic (§2.x) rules are
# NOT allowlisted per file: they are enforced as regression checks on lines you
# actually touch (delta mode). Pre-existing occurrences are cleaned up via their
# own issues, not this allowlist.

